## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. Start backend: `cd backend && uvicorn app.main:app --reload`
2. Test MongoDB connection: Visit `http://localhost:8000/health`
3. Test Shopify connect: POST to `/api/shopify/connect` with real credentials
4. Test product sync: POST to `/api/shopify/sync-products`
5. Verify products saved: GET `/api/products`
6. Verify analytics: GET `/api/analytics/summary`

### Manual Verification
1. Run frontend at `http://localhost:5173`
2. Navigate to Connect Store page → enter real Shopify credentials
3. Click "Sync Products" → verify products appear in database
4. Navigate to Products page → verify real products display
5. Navigate to Dashboard → verify analytics show real counts
